        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "How old is Link?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_001_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:36:39+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "I've always wanted to ask, but I keep forgetting. So I waited until I woke up from my nap today to ask.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_002_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:36:41+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "I don't know! The games have been around for twenty years, so Link's age probably varies a lot.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_003_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:36:43+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Your princess can even travel from ancient times to the present, between different eras.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_004_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T17:21:00+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Why?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_005_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:36:49+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "It's mainly because there are so many games, and they span such a long time. Characters can even come back to life after they die, so I really don't know.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/en-us/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_006_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:36:51+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "006",
