      "clips": [
        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "林克几岁了",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "林克几岁了？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我一直都想问，就是有时候又忘、有时候又忘。我就等今天中午睡完起来才问。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我不知道！游戏都出来20年了，然后林克的跨度估计很大。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "你的公主还能从古代穿到现代，各个时代在穿。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "为什么啊？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "主要是游戏出来很多款，游戏的跨度太大，死了也能复活，所以说我也不知道。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
