            "voice_id": "aQROLel5sQbj1vuIVi6B",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Quel âge a Link ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_001_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:42:39+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Je voulais te le demander depuis longtemps, mais j'oubliais à chaque fois. Alors j'ai attendu de me réveiller de ma sieste de ce midi pour te le demander.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_002_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:42:42+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Je ne sais pas ! Les jeux existent depuis vingt ans, donc l'âge de Link doit beaucoup varier.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_003_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:42:45+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Même ta princesse peut voyager de l'Antiquité jusqu'à l'époque moderne. Elle traverse toutes les époques.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_004_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:42:47+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "UBXZKOKbt62aLQHhc1Jm",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Pourquoi ?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_005_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-10-06T19:42:48+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "nr2EGJNe96rzn9FRlTId",
            "model_id": "eleven_v4",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "similarity_boost": 1.0,
            "stability": 0.5
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "C'est surtout parce qu'il y a beaucoup de jeux et qu'ils couvrent une très longue période. Les personnages peuvent même ressusciter après leur mort, alors je ne sais vraiment pas.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/fr-fr/2026-08-20-how-old-is-link_dialogue_006_fr-fr.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
